  "description": "The Aspire Zelos M80 Mod delivers powerful performance and advanced functionality in a compact, durable form factor. Designed for vapers who prefer to pair their own tank, this device features an integrated 2600mAh battery and supports up to 80W of adjustable output, catering to both restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) and mouth-to-lung (MTL) vaping styles. The Zelos M80’s 0.96\" TFT colour screen offers clear, easy-to-read information with adjustable brightness, while intuitive controls allow you to switch between five versatile output modes: Variable Wattage, Variable Voltage, Bypass, Temperature Control, and CPS (Customisable Power Setting). Dual LED indicators provide visual feedback, and Aspire’s ASP chipset offers a full suite of safety protections for reliable day-to-day use. Finished in premium metal alloy with reinforced edges, the Zelos M80 Mod combines robust build quality with modern styling, making it a dependable choice for any 510-threaded tank setup.",
